<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/elagabalus" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/elagabalus.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/march-13">13 March</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">The Praetorian Guard murders Emperor Elagabalus and his mother</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/praetorian-guard">Praetorian Guard</a> killed the teenage emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elagabalus">Elagabalus</a>, whose religious innovations had caused scandal, together with his mother, Julia Soaemias. His cousin <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/severus-alexander">Severus Alexander</a>, the last ruler of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/severan-dynasty">Severan dynasty</a>, succeeded him.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elagabalus">Elagabalus</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/severus-alexander">Severus Alexander</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
